WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_DevilsFee_DiabolistLetter_Ninefingers</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_DevilsFee_DiabolistLetter_Ninefingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_DevilsFee_DiabolistLetter_Ninefingers\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">63f6945c-0f59-444d-b6f0-b22340b51e38</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:63f6945c-0f59-444d-b6f0-b22340b51e38\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:63f6945c-0f59-444d-b6f0-b22340b51e38\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Bruc_and_Pishe%27s_Emporium\" title=\"Bruc and Pishe's Emporium\">Bruc and Pishe's Emporium</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2341&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1054</span></li>\n<li>On a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Desk\" title=\"Wooden Desk\">Wooden Desk</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nine-Fingers\">Nine-Fingers'</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall#Nine-Fingers'_Office\" title=\"Guildhall\">office</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-40&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;775</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Kingpins: \n</p><p>Take note of the 'diabolist', <a href=\"/wiki/Helsik\" title=\"Helsik\">Helsik</a>, at the <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a>, a person valuable to know if you need information on infernal matters - for example, when blackmailing a target with a fear of devils and the diabolic. \n</p><p><br>\nThe rumour is that this diabolist has even opened a transplanar portal to the Hells for <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash</a> back in his organised crime days - useful knowledge if you want to terrorise someone by threatening to send them to <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202641\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1366/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25468/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6982/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935718/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.475      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.475      1 -total\n 49.70%   20.614      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.41%   18.420     15 Template:Trim\n 24.69%   10.238      2 Template:Uid\n 16.16%    6.704      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.35%    5.95